Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix worker crash, add email alerts, wire up frontend

- worker: tasks.py imported the deleted notifications module, so the worker
  and beat crashed on start. Add SMTP email notifications instead of Telegram.
- worker: record last_error / last_checked_at, configurable check interval,
  demo_price.py helper, unit tests (now run in CI).
- backend: alert_email field, queue a price check on add, POST /products/{id}/check,
  CORS for 127.0.0.1 origins + CORS_ORIGINS env.
- frontend: Add Product button now works, dashboard uses real data,
  Check Now button, shared Header, View History opens the right product.
- docs: run + demo instructions, .env.example for SMTP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
